The Midnight Sun is the explosive built by the [[Org/Actinium Convox/index|Actinium Convox]] under the Final Dawn project. Its makers called it the bomb to end all wars. It is too fragile to be dropped from an aircraft or moved far: it has to be carried whole into position and planted at the center of a [[Phenomena/Ley Line|ley line]], where it runs a chain reaction along the [[Phenomena/Weave|weave]]. Planted so on the Night of the Midnight Sun, it unmade [[Geography/Færrin/Raelion/index|Raelion]].

Because the bomb cannot be carried to its target, it is sent ahead by a beacon: a silver spike about a foot long, tipped with a great pearl. A bearer enters the fane of a [[Phenomena/Hearts|Heart]] and drives the beacon into the Heart's middle. The beacon draws its power from the Heart and gives Calaria a lock on the spot, and the bomb is transmitted into its place. A black pillar arrives with it, set with a screen and a keyboard, and the command the screen shows must be entered to arm it. The same beacon carries the bearer back out, if there is time.
